#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Local Creative Studio – stdlib-only backend for localllama-setup.

Single-user local service on 127.0.0.1:8700. Proxies inference to the
llama.cpp router (:8080), image jobs to local-image-ai-service (:7861),
research to websearch-mcp (:8642). Never binds off-loopback, never calls
paid/cloud APIs, starts no second inference engine.

Commands: serve | status | doctor | uninstall [--purge-data]
"""

